<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47703" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tempē</span></b> , indecl.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>plur. n.</i>, =
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τέμπη, τἁ</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>a charming valley in
				Thessaly</i>, <i>through which ran the river
				Peneus</i>, <i>between Olympus and Ossa</i>, now
				<i>valley of Lykostomo</i> or <i>Dereli</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 3, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 8,
				15, § 31</span></i>; <i><span class="en">16, 44, 92, §
			244</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 44, 6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">33, 35</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hor. C. 1,
			7</span></i>; <i><span class="en">4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">1, 21, 9</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">3, 1, 24: Peneia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 4, 317</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 7, 222</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, of other beautiful valleys: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frigida,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 2, 469</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Ov. F. 4, 477</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Am. 1,
				1, 15</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cycneia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. M.
					7, 371</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Stat. Th. 1, 485</span></i> (cf. written as Greek:
			Reatini me ad sua <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέμπη</span> duxerunt,
				<i><span class="en">Cic.
				Att. 4, 15, 5</span></i>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
